1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,000
LegacyLens: a running ASP.NET Web Forms service-case application
Public NYC 311 categories; synthetic customers and assignees

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Create and update a real SQL-backed case with history
This is an explicitly synthetic demonstration

3
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:46,000
WEB-001: unconditional Page_Load binding is injected in isolation
A real Postback overwrites the unsaved draft

4
00:00:46,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Fix: bind only on the initial request and preserve posted values
The identical regression fails before and passes after repair

5
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:20,000
SQL-001: 100,000 official records, 5 warmups and 40 measured runs
Local warm-cache results; no production SLA claim

6
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:41,000
CHANGE-001: manager-only transfer, reason and concurrency checks
An identical request key does not duplicate history

7
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Case changes, history and audit commit in one SQL transaction
Correlation IDs connect the evidence

8
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Small layers, reproducible measurements and traceable maintenance
54 NUnit/SQL tests and 11 Chromium E2E passed locally
